        <dcterms:description xml:lang="en">volume of data, which is usually dependent on the respective complexity of the information or its coding
    procedure, divided by the related area
  </dcterms:description>
        <qudt:plainTextDescription xml:lang="de">Anzahl von Daten, die in der Regel abhängig von der jeweiligen Komplexität der Information oder
