        <qudt:latexDefinition rdf:datatype="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString">$\chi = -(\frac{1}{V})\frac{dV}{d\rho}$, where $V$ is volume and $p$ is pressure.</qudt:latexDefinition>
