    electron at the lowest level of the conduction band in an insulator or semiconductor. The the amount of energy released when
    an electron is added to a neutral atom or molecule to form a negative ion.
  </qudt:plainTextDescription>
        <qudt:symbol>χ</qudt:symbol>
