        <qudt:informativeReference rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">http://wiki.answers.com/Q/What_is_magnitude_of_force</qudt:informativeReference>
        <qudt:plainTextDescription>The &apos;magnitude&apos; of a force is its &apos;size&apos; or &apos;strength&apos;, regardless of the direction in which it
