        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString">A quantity kind that is a proportionality constant that relates the partial pressure of a gas above a
    liquid and the concentration of the gas dissolved in the liquid.  The numerator contains the gaseous concentration and the
    denominator contains the liquid concentration.
  </dcterms:description>
