    a liquid and the concentration of the gas dissolved in the liquid.  The numerator contains the gaseous concentration and the
    denominator contains the liquid concentration.
  </qudt:plainTextDescription>
        <rdfs:comment>Applicable units are those of quantitykind:HenrysLawVolatilityConstant</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind"/>
