        <qudt:plainTextDescription>The &quot;InternalConversionFactor&quot; describes the rate of internal conversion. It is the ratio of the
    number of internal conversion electrons to the number of gamma quanta emitted by the radioactive atom in a given transition.
  </qudt:plainTextDescription>
