        <qudt:plainTextDescription>Another name for Force Per Length, used by the Industry Foundation Classes (IFC) standard.</qudt:plainTextDescription>
        <rdfs:comment>Applicable units are those of quantitykind:ForcePerLength</rdfs:comment>
