        <qudt:latexDefinition rdf:datatype="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString">$E = T + V$, where $T$ is kinetic energy and $V$ is potential energy.</qudt:latexDefinition>
        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString">Mechanical Energy is the sum of potential energy and kinetic energy. It is the energy associated with the
