        <qudt:latexDefinition rdf:datatype="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString">$E = \frac{\sigma}{\varepsilon}$, where $\sigma$ is the normal stress and $\varepsilon$ is the linear strain.</qudt:latexDefinition>
        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString">The Modulus of Elasticity is the mathematical description of an object or substance&apos;s tendency to be
