  </dcterms:description>
        <qudt:informativeReference rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Radius</qudt:informativeReference>
        <qudt:plainTextDescription>In classical geometry, the &quot;Radius&quot; of a circle or sphere is any line segment from its center to
