        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString">The &quot;Rate of Change of Frequency&quot; is the rate of change of frequency with respect to time. It is used in
    power systems to describe the rate at which the frequency of the system is changing.
  </dcterms:description>
        <qudt:informativeReference rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://eepublicdownloads.entsoe.eu/clean-documents/SOC%20documents/Inertia%20and%20RoCoF_v17_clean.pdf</qudt:informativeReference>
