        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString">Sound power or acoustic power $P_a$ is a measure of sonic energy $E$ per time $t$ unit. It is measured in
    watts and can be computed as sound intensity ($I$) times area ($A$).
  </dcterms:description>
