        <qudt:latexDefinition rdf:datatype="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString">$R = 10 \log (\frac{1}{\tau}) dB$, where $\tau$ is the transmission factor.</qudt:latexDefinition>
        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString">The Sound Reduction Index is used to measure the level of sound insulation provided by a structure such
    as a wall, window, door, or ventilator.
  </dcterms:description>
        <qudt:informativeReference rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sound_reduction_index</qudt:informativeReference>
        <qudt:plainTextDescription>The Sound Reduction Index is used to measure the level of sound insulation provided by a structure
    such as a wall, window, door, or ventilator.
  </qudt:plainTextDescription>
