        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString">&quot;Specific Electric Current&quot; is a measure to specify the applied current relative to a corresponding mass.
    This measure is often used for standardization within electrochemistry.
  </dcterms:description>
