        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">A measure used to express how a current is subject to temperature. Originally used in Wien&apos;s Law to
    describe phenomena related to filaments. One use today is to express how a current generator derates with temperature.
  </dcterms:description>
