        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString">The $\textit{ampere-turn}$ was the MKS unit of magnetomotive force (MMF), represented by a direct
    current of one ampere flowing in a single-turn loop in a vacuum. &quot;Turns&quot; refers to the winding number of an electrical
