        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString">The amount of energy generated by a pound of substance is measured in British thermal units (IT) per
    pound of mass. 1 $Btu_{IT}/lb$ is equivalent to $2.326 \times 10^3$ joule per kilogram (J/kg).
  </dcterms:description>
