        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#HTML">Meter Per Day (m/day) is a unit in the category of Velocity. It is also known as meter/day, meters per
    day, metre per day, metres per day. Meter Per Day (m/day) has a dimension of L*T-1 where L is length, and T is time. It can be
    converted to the corresponding standard SI unit m/s by multiplying its value by a factor of 0.00001157407407407407
  </dcterms:description>
        <qudt:expression rdf:datatype="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString">\(m/day\)</qudt:expression>
