        <dcterms:description rdf:datatype="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/LatexString">Relative permeability, denoted by the symbol $\mu _T$, is the ratio of the permeability of a specific
    medium to the permeability of free space $\mu _0$
  </dcterms:description>
